The present paper feels stronger and more focused than the weakest of these (e.g., X6xzYP2cMk, cxKLRM3KhC), but clearly below the thoroughness and alignment of claims in i8vPRlsrYu or qtTIP5Gjc5. Its main drawback is not correctness but overclaiming and insufficient practical grounding of its central condition. Relative to the calibration set, this places it in the mid‑range, around a borderline but somewhat below‑threshold level.

